@startuml

title User Profile Flow

actor User
participant "API" as API
participant "UserRepository" as UserRepo

== 取得個人資料 ==

User -> API : GET /users/me\n[Authorization: Bearer accessToken]
API -> UserRepo : GetById(userId)

alt User 不存在
    API --> User : 404 Not Found
end

API --> User : 200\n{ id, name, email, phone, roles, address?, avatar? }

== 更新個人資料 ==

User -> API : PUT /users/me\n{ name?, phone?, address? }
API -> UserRepo : GetById(userId)
API -> API : user.Update(command)
note right : 比較哪些欄位有變動才更新
API -> UserRepo : Save()
API --> User : 200 OK

== 更換頭像 ==

User -> API : PUT /users/me/avatar\n{ image file } (multipart/form-data)
API -> API : ImageStorage.UploadAsync(image)
API -> UserRepo : GetById(userId)
API -> API : user.UpdateAvatar(url, publicId)
API -> UserRepo : Save()
API --> User : 200 { avatarUrl }

@enduml
